Ident 3:0
Manufacturer ETC
Console Expression
$$SoftwareVersion Vsn 3.11
Clear All
Set Channels 250
Set Dimmers 700

! Hand-crafted sample in the layout of ETC Expression 3 ASCII exports
! (Patch with @Hff levels, Chan ch@level, Sub, $MlAttribute / $MlPers / $MlPatch).

! Channel Patch

Patch 1 1<1@Hff 2<2@Hff 3<3@Hff 4<4@Hff 5<5@Hff 5<6@Hff
Patch 1 6<513@Hff 7<514@H80 101<201@Hff

! Cues
! $$CueBlock:   Block type (0=none, 1=block, 2=allfade)

Cue 1
   Text Preset
   Up 3
   Down 5
   Chan 1@Hff 2@H80 3@H33 101@Hff 102@H80 104@Hff

Cue 2
   Text House to half
   Up 3 1
   Down 3 2
   Chan 1@H80 2@H80 6@Hff
   $$CueBlock 1

Cue 2.5
   Text Followed
   Up 1:30
   Down 0
   Chan 7@Hff 99@Hff

! Groups

Group 1
   Text Front
   Chan 1@Hff 2@Hff 3@Hff

Group 2
   Chan 4@H80 5@H80

! Submasters

Sub 1 1
   Up 0
   Down 0
   Chan 6@Hff 7@Hff
   $$Dwell 0 1
   $$BumpType 0

! $MlAttribute:   Number(1-64), Attribute name (6 character max)

$MlAttribute  1 Intens
   $$MlCategory 4
$MlAttribute  2 Pan
   $$MlCategory 1
$MlAttribute  3 Tilt
   $$MlCategory 1
$MlAttribute  4 Color
   $$MlCategory 3

$MlPers TinySpot
   $$MlPersChan   0   2   128 I L M
   $$MlPersChan   1   2   0 I L
   $$MlPersChan   2   3   128 I L M
   $$MlPersChan   3   3   0 I L
   $$MlPersChan   4   4   0 I L
   $$MlPersChan   5   1   0 I

$MlPatch 1
   $$Pr TinySpot
   $$FixtPatch   101  1 201

$FocusPoint 1
   Chan 102@H40 103@H40

Enddata
